Revision history for Data-LnArray-XS

0.12    2026-10-23
        - Fix list returns overrunning the stack (retrieve, values, keys, entries, forEach)
        - Fix entries returning half its pairs, find and findIndex returning NULL
        - Fix map, forEach and sort losing callback results on perls before 5.12
        - Fix $_ refcounting in from and forEach, and from taking over the caller's array
        - Fix reduce and reduceRight ignoring the initial value
        - Export with Ex::Op instead of Import::Export, perl 5.10 or later

0.01    Date/time
        First version, released on an unsuspecting world.

